window.CET6_DATA("data/articles/day-002.json",{"day":2,"title":"The Harbor Beyond the Tourist Map","targetWords":[{"word":"adventure","gloss":"冒险","context":"The students had expected an adventure, and some looked disappointed when we boarded a van at the station.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"subway","gloss":"地铁","context":"Our museum expedition began with an ordinary subway ride through a tunnel, rather than a dramatic departure by jet.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"tunnel","gloss":"隧道","context":"Our museum expedition began with an ordinary subway ride through a tunnel, rather than a dramatic departure by jet.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"collar","gloss":"衣领","context":"The collar of a ceremonial costume carried a ribbon awarded to a sailor; a heavy fur hat belonged to a trader who had crossed northern waters.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"expedition","gloss":"考察","context":"Our museum expedition began with an ordinary subway ride through a tunnel, rather than a dramatic departure by jet.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"hat","gloss":"帽子","context":"The collar of a ceremonial costume carried a ribbon awarded to a sailor; a heavy fur hat belonged to a trader who had crossed northern waters.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"yellow","gloss":"黄色","context":"At the port, a ferry was preparing to sail, its yellow stripe bright against the gray water.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"cap","gloss":"帽子","context":"Inside the museum, a silk blouse with a pearl button stood beside a worn boot and a railway cap.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"cart","gloss":"手推车","context":"A worker wearing a helmet and a leather glove checked the anchor while another pushed luggage on a cart.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"gray","gloss":"灰色的","context":"At the port, a ferry was preparing to sail, its yellow stripe bright against the gray water.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"jet","gloss":"喷气式飞机","context":"Our museum expedition began with an ordinary subway ride through a tunnel, rather than a dramatic departure by jet.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"luggage","gloss":"行李","context":"A worker wearing a helmet and a leather glove checked the anchor while another pushed luggage on a cart.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"vessel","gloss":"船","context":"The vessel belonged to a small fleet that made public transit possible between the islands.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"visa","gloss":"签证","context":"On its deck, we imagined an earlier voyage when a passport and a visa might determine whether a family could leave.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"brake","gloss":"制动器","context":"An old carriage had once taken passengers from the harbor to an airfield, where early pilots depended on careful maintenance of every brake.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"carrier","gloss":"运输工具","context":"Learning to read a city, she said, meant understanding how a carrier of goods could become a barrier to human movement.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"passport","gloss":"护照","context":"On its deck, we imagined an earlier voyage when a passport and a visa might determine whether a family could leave.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"pink","gloss":"粉红色","context":"A pink travel poster promised effortless escape, concealing the labor behind the promise.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"leather","gloss":"皮革","context":"A worker wearing a helmet and a leather glove checked the anchor while another pushed luggage on a cart.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"van","gloss":"面包车","context":"The students had expected an adventure, and some looked disappointed when we boarded a van at the station.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"cruise","gloss":"游船旅行","context":"The harbor was more than a pleasant setting for a sightseeing cruise: it recorded decisions about belonging.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"helmet","gloss":"头盔","context":"A worker wearing a helmet and a leather glove checked the anchor while another pushed luggage on a cart.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"lorry","gloss":"货车","context":"Our guide, a pedestrian campaigner, asked us to notice a lorry braking near the crossing.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"button","gloss":"纽扣","context":"Inside the museum, a silk blouse with a pearl button stood beside a worn boot and a railway cap.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"pearl","gloss":"珍珠","context":"Inside the museum, a silk blouse with a pearl button stood beside a worn boot and a railway cap.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"aviation","gloss":"航空","context":"The final gallery connected maritime history with aviation.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"deck","gloss":"甲板","context":"On its deck, we imagined an earlier voyage when a passport and a visa might determine whether a family could leave.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"ribbon","gloss":"绶带","context":"The collar of a ceremonial costume carried a ribbon awarded to a sailor; a heavy fur hat belonged to a trader who had crossed northern waters.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"boot","gloss":"靴子","context":"Inside the museum, a silk blouse with a pearl button stood beside a worn boot and a railway cap.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"crown","gloss":"王冠","context":"A royal crown, displayed behind glass, attracted more cameras than these ordinary objects.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"transit","gloss":"公共交通","context":"The vessel belonged to a small fleet that made public transit possible between the islands.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"voyage","gloss":"航行","context":"On its deck, we imagined an earlier voyage when a passport and a visa might determine whether a family could leave.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"bypass","gloss":"绕开","context":"A road once built as a bypass now divided two neighborhoods.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"fur","gloss":"毛皮","context":"The collar of a ceremonial costume carried a ribbon awarded to a sailor; a heavy fur hat belonged to a trader who had crossed northern waters.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"pedestrian","gloss":"行人","context":"Our guide, a pedestrian campaigner, asked us to notice a lorry braking near the crossing.","contextParagraph":0,"collocation":null},{"word":"sail","gloss":"启航","context":"At the port, a ferry was preparing to sail, its yellow stripe bright against the gray water.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"sightseeing","gloss":"观光","context":"The harbor was more than a pleasant setting for a sightseeing cruise: it recorded decisions about belonging.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"silk","gloss":"丝","context":"Inside the museum, a silk blouse with a pearl button stood beside a worn boot and a railway cap.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"carriage","gloss":"马车","context":"An old carriage had once taken passengers from the harbor to an airfield, where early pilots depended on careful maintenance of every brake.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"ferry","gloss":"渡船","context":"At the port, a ferry was preparing to sail, its yellow stripe bright against the gray water.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"port","gloss":"港口","context":"At the port, a ferry was preparing to sail, its yellow stripe bright against the gray water.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"blouse","gloss":"女衬衫","context":"Inside the museum, a silk blouse with a pearl button stood beside a worn boot and a railway cap.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"costume","gloss":"礼服","context":"The collar of a ceremonial costume carried a ribbon awarded to a sailor; a heavy fur hat belonged to a trader who had crossed northern waters.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"excursion","gloss":"短途旅行","context":"Students compared it with modern advertisements, which turn every excursion into a perfect image.","contextParagraph":3,"collocation":null},{"word":"fleet","gloss":"船队","context":"The vessel belonged to a small fleet that made public transit possible between the islands.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"glove","gloss":"手套","context":"A worker wearing a helmet and a leather glove checked the anchor while another pushed luggage on a cart.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"stripe","gloss":"条纹","context":"At the port, a ferry was preparing to sail, its yellow stripe bright against the gray water.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"garment","gloss":"衣服","context":"Each garment told a different story about work.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null},{"word":"anchor","gloss":"船锚","context":"A worker wearing a helmet and a leather glove checked the anchor while another pushed luggage on a cart.","contextParagraph":1,"collocation":null},{"word":"jewel","gloss":"珠宝","context":"Yet the guide suggested that a single repaired sleeve could reveal as much about an economy as a jewel worn at court.","contextParagraph":2,"collocation":null}],"paragraphs":[{"en":"Our museum expedition began with an ordinary subway ride through a tunnel, rather than a dramatic departure by jet. The students had expected an adventure, and some looked disappointed when we boarded a van at the station. Our guide, a pedestrian campaigner, asked us to notice a lorry braking near the crossing. A road once built as a bypass now divided two neighborhoods. Learning to read a city, she said, meant understanding how a carrier of goods could become a barrier to human movement.","zh":"我们的博物馆考察从一段普通的地铁行程开始，穿过隧道，并没有乘喷气式飞机隆重启程。学生们原本期待一场冒险，在车站上面包车时，有些人露出了失望的表情。导游倡导保护行人的权益，她让我们留意一辆在路口刹车的货车。一条当年为绕行修建的道路如今隔开了两个社区。她说，要读懂城市，就要理解运货的交通工具怎样也可能妨碍人的行动。"},{"en":"At the port, a ferry was preparing to sail, its yellow stripe bright against the gray water. A worker wearing a helmet and a leather glove checked the anchor while another pushed luggage on a cart. The vessel belonged to a small fleet that made public transit possible between the islands. On its deck, we imagined an earlier voyage when a passport and a visa might determine whether a family could leave. The harbor was more than a pleasant setting for a sightseeing cruise: it recorded decisions about belonging.","zh":"港口里，一艘渡船正准备启航，黄色条纹在灰色水面映衬下格外醒目。一个戴头盔和皮手套的工人检查船锚，另一个人用小车搬运行李。这条船属于一支小型船队，负责岛屿之间的公共交通。在甲板上，我们想象起从前的航程：护照和签证或许决定着一家人能否离开。港口不仅是观光游船的优美背景，也记录着关于归属的种种决定。"},{"en":"Inside the museum, a silk blouse with a pearl button stood beside a worn boot and a railway cap. Each garment told a different story about work. The collar of a ceremonial costume carried a ribbon awarded to a sailor; a heavy fur hat belonged to a trader who had crossed northern waters. A royal crown, displayed behind glass, attracted more cameras than these ordinary objects. Yet the guide suggested that a single repaired sleeve could reveal as much about an economy as a jewel worn at court.","zh":"博物馆里，一件缀着珍珠纽扣的丝绸女衬衫，与一只旧靴子和一顶铁路工作帽摆在一起。每件衣物都讲述着不同的劳动故事。一套礼服的领口带着授予水手的绶带；一顶厚毛皮帽曾属于穿越北方海域的商人。玻璃柜里的王冠比这些普通物品吸引了更多镜头。但导游认为，一个修补过的袖口，也能像宫廷珠宝一样揭示经济生活。"},{"en":"The final gallery connected maritime history with aviation. An old carriage had once taken passengers from the harbor to an airfield, where early pilots depended on careful maintenance of every brake. A pink travel poster promised effortless escape, concealing the labor behind the promise. Students compared it with modern advertisements, which turn every excursion into a perfect image. Even our own outing had required maintenance workers, cleaners, drivers, and ticket sellers whom photographs would probably omit.","zh":"最后一个展厅把航海史与航空史联系起来。旧式马车曾把旅客从港口送往机场，早期飞行员则依赖对每个制动部件的精心保养。一张粉色旅游海报承诺轻松逃离日常，却隐藏了实现承诺所需的劳动。学生们把它与现代广告比较，发现广告总把短途旅行包装成完美画面。就连我们这次出行，也离不开维修人员、清洁工、司机和售票员，而照片很可能不会留下他们。"},{"en":"On the return journey, the students no longer regarded the harbor as a collection of picturesque objects. They discussed whose stories the museum preserved and whose it overlooked. A day away from the classroom had changed the meaning of exploration. We had not discovered a distant island; we had discovered how much ordinary movement depends on invisible cooperation. That insight was a more durable souvenir than anything sold in the gift shop. The next classroom discussion considered how tourism could support this cooperation, provided that visitors recognized local residents as participants in a living economy rather than as scenery around their holidays. Residents would help evaluate proposals, so that the benefits promised to visitors could also be examined from local experience.","zh":"返程时，学生们不再把港口仅仅看成一组风景优美的物件。他们讨论博物馆保存了谁的故事，又忽略了谁。离开课堂的一天改变了探索的含义。我们没有发现遥远的岛屿，却发现了日常出行对无形协作的依赖。与礼品店里出售的任何东西相比，这种认识都是更持久的纪念。下一次课堂讨论思考了旅游怎样支持这种协作：前提是游客把居民视为现实经济的参与者，而不是度假生活的背景。居民将参与评估提案，让针对游客许诺的益处也能接受本地经验的检验。"}],"previous":1,"next":3});
